  "---- charts-energy channel list. Copy this file to charts-energy/energy-channels.json and set ENERGY_CHANNELS_FILE=/config/energy-channels.json in your .env. It takes priority over the single-line ENERGY_CHANNELS. ----",
  "---- The three modes: feed = tops up an EXISTING charts-sync playlist via its theme (the theme MUST byte-match the {service:energy, theme:<name>} source in charts-sync/charts.json). library = download-only, year-tagged, shown by decade via Navidrome Smart Playlists (no .m3u). own = writes its own energy-*.m3u (reserved namespace). ----",

